#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: Confirm deployment and establish the immediate objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l001"
msgstr "ROOK, déploiement confirmé. Tour résidentielle Ashfall, secteur sept."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R01
#. Intent: State the required mission sequence concisely.
#: missions/m01.md:R01
msgid "dialogue.m01.com01.l002"
msgstr "Rétablissez l'alimentation du secteur, récupérez l'équipe de sécurité piégée et atteignez la liaison de transit."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Establish that VECTOR is active elsewhere in Ashfall District.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l001"
msgstr "TOUR, VECTEUR. Je suis à deux pâtés de maisons à l'est. Même incendie, mêmes communications mortes."

#. Speaker: VECTOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R02
#. Intent: Direct attention toward the drones without stopping the tutorial.
#: missions/m01.md:R02
msgid "dialogue.m01.com02.l002"
msgstr "Quelque chose dirige les drones vers les étages occupés. Je vais le retracer à partir d'ici."

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Introduce the first contradiction in ROOK’s remembered history.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l001"
msgstr "Capitaine ?"

#. Speaker: SECURITY_OFFICER
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Make the recognition specific without explaining it.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l002"
msgstr "Je t'ai vu mourir à Kestrel Bridge. Il y a huit ans."

#. Speaker: ROOK
#. Delivery: In person
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Keep ROOK controlled and focused on the rescue.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com03.l003"
msgstr "Vous vous trompez de soldat. Pouvez-vous bouger ?"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Offer a plausible explanation while redirecting the mission.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l001"
msgstr "L’exposition neurologique peut produire une fausse reconnaissance et une fausse projection d’identité."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Radio
#. Room: R06
#. Intent: Close the interruption and return the player to the objective.
#: missions/m01.md:R06
msgid "dialogue.m01.com04.l002"
msgstr "Sécurisez le survivant et continuez votre transit."

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M06 arrival; OPERATOR's final direct address before becoming unreachable.
#: missions/m06.md
msgid "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"
msgstr "dialogue.m06.com01.l001"

#. Speaker: OPERATOR
#. Delivery: Facility channel
#. Intent: M09 Imprint Zero activation; machine-directed command, not an address to the crew.
